{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Resurgence thrusts players into a <strong>relentless, retro-futuristic roguelike space shooter</strong>\u00a0where survival is the sole mission. Navigate cosmic battlefields, <strong>master intense bullet-hell combat</strong>, and scavenge for every scrap of hope in a galaxy consumed by chaos. <strong>Every death serves as a lesson</strong>, and every run presents a new opportunity to defy the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/386866b124d48866ae3dcdf2d4fc8df8.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/386866b124d48866ae3dcdf2d4fc8df8.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>endless replayability</strong>. No two runs are ever the same, ensuring fresh challenges and discoveries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not the end,</strong>\u00a0learn from setbacks and return stronger. Unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, new ships, and powerful abilities that persist across runs, enabling deeper delves into the void with each attempt.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>unique synergies and builds</strong>\u00a0as a vast arsenal of weapons and modules is collected, allowing for adaptive strategies to survive the ever-escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/f77965f475e82ce5579c3bfbfde23513.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/f77965f475e82ce5579c3bfbfde23513.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Resurgence, everyone has their time-window of <strong>Glory!</strong>\u00a0Compete across\u00a0<strong>480 unique global leaderboards</strong>\u00a0and etch your name among the stars as one of the galaxy's true aces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/7de65c3f4fd2a2fb4d5001a8b7017b8c.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/7de65c3f4fd2a2fb4d5001a8b7017b8c.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>fast-paced, pixel-perfect space combat</strong>\u00a0against swarms of alien adversaries and <strong>colossal bosses</strong>. The action is frantic and demands constant attention.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge intricate bullet-hell patterns that demand precision and quick reflexes. The ship's <strong>compact hitbox</strong>\u00a0allows for thrilling near-miss escapes, rewarding skillful navigation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a devastating array of retro-inspired weaponry, from rapid-fire lasers to <strong>screen-clearing super bombs</strong>. Feel the impact of every shot with satisfying hit indicators and explosive visual feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/08a0932e489f3ea40ed8815e850311a8.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/08a0932e489f3ea40ed8815e850311a8.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Resurgence, survival isn't just about one successful run\u2014it's about <strong>persistent growth and ultimate mastery</strong>\u00a0over the chaos. Become stronger with every attempt and conquer the galaxy on your own terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/7a7677feb6c93569bec547e4cdbf5d91.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/7a7677feb6c93569bec547e4cdbf5d91.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock <strong>10 distinct ships</strong>, each offering a unique playstyle and strategic advantages. Find the vessel that perfectly complements your combat philosophy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of <strong>20 Core Systems</strong>, the fundamental building blocks of your playstyle. Mix and match offensive cannons, defensive shields, and unique engines to architect a loadout that is entirely your own.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover profound synergies between them to unleash <strong>16 devastating Hyper Powers</strong>\u00a0for game-changing abilities that reward experimentation and can turn the tide of the most desperate battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/18d194076637bcad20d752a55efa885f.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/18d194076637bcad20d752a55efa885f.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your build and your reflexes against <strong>formidable bosses</strong>. Each encounter is a monumental challenge, demanding mastery of the game's mechanics and a solid strategy to overcome their devastating power.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the cosmic chaos with <strong>four difficulty levels</strong>. Whether you're looking for a casual flight or a hardcore, leaderboard-chasing challenge, the Void has a setting for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/3446158f600b9c917e2bacf2409bde8f.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/3446158f600b9c917e2bacf2409bde8f.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a visually striking world rendered with <strong>crisp pixel art and vibrant neon palettes</strong>, reminiscent of arcade classics. The aesthetic provides a unique and nostalgic backdrop for the action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groove to an <strong>original chiptune soundtrack</strong>\u00a0that perfectly complements the high-octane action and nostalgic atmosphere, enhancing immersion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>classic arcade challenge blended with modern roguelike depth</strong>, offering a fresh yet familiar thrill that appeals to both veteran and new players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/9100e93962b269123287270d17ea924e.avif?t=1759152604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras_big/9100e93962b269123287270d17ea924e.webp?t=1759152604 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void is vast, but pilots do not have to face it alone. <strong>Join the growing community on Discord</strong>\u00a0to share strategies, provide feedback, and connect with fellow pilots. Player insights help shape the future of Void Resurgence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All Systems Online","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/af46ea36ecb8ace8cf719a5119510e834538611a.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/56ef213bdde91c86dee005745a3780eb5cf4391e.jpg"},{"name":"Void Marathon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/b7f8a2bf35b0bfe29ca4dfde826d3cbfee9365f5.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Vacuum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/597d13278f038be533dee95e25f9616b0e3f02dd.jpg"},{"name":"Victory in the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/758a8a105132b7daad9b6ec5ec3665724bde7344.jpg"},{"name":"Against All Odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/c82171c5411ffad0b52cd3ca4ee36be1b7b3d6f2.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/44ebea858ef8eb13e38e21cfbe7ee5a8a1c55f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Impossible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/cd70f54393f9daa6204c79085ff04afa26e33271.jpg"},{"name":"Power Overwhelming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/2e2abe01daf7f619f4f239ac5ef909731d1b271f.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of All Trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3669050/d0198a137aaa9c6fb8d689c2e2eef011262a4a40.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669050?t=1759152604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/f8e81f00b9fa672042755763b256c9a27fea7f61/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759152604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/a0067fbc984c5d183ac57274bba34cd30f9be2b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759152604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/a0067fbc984c5d183ac57274bba34cd30f9be2b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759152604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3845920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Resurgence thrusts players into a <strong>relentless, retro-futuristic roguelike space shooter</strong>\u00a0where survival is the sole mission. Navigate cosmic battlefields, <strong>master intense bullet-hell combat</strong>, and scavenge for every scrap of hope in a galaxy consumed by chaos. <strong>Every death serves as a lesson</strong>, and every run presents a new opportunity to defy the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669050/extras/386866b124d48866ae